<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 7.21 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate rises to 7.21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose slightly to 7.21 percent on Sunday from 7.04 percent on Saturday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said ten banks traded on the market in 18 reported transactions with a total value of 15 million dinars ($21 million)</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
